The Python research code (models, search, data pipeline) is original work
in this repository and is likewise made available under GPL-3.0-or-later
to keep one consistent license for the combined system. See
native/licenses/THIRD_PARTY_DX7_README.md and native/source-provenance.json
for exact upstream provenance and file-level attribution.
